From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 05:22:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/24] Vizzbox 1.1: the user's hand on the producer's tracks
 (BRIEF-VIZZBOX-1.1.md 2)

What the user takes of the producer's tracks stays theirs until given back: a sound chosen (any load: PRESETS,
USER, the EDIT layer, a MIDI Program Change, the editor, an FM6 or DRUM-X sheet, an undo; ui.c load_begin) stays
over a new style, a favourite, ENDLESS's next subgenre, STOP and PLAY (vb_sound, vb_swap; the song's key still set
for the keys); a parameter turned (a knob in the VIZZBOX or the GROOVEBOX, the editor, a CC through Skiff's map;
motion.c motion_capture) the producer no longer moves (vb_isr) nor sets anew; a bus turned (edit_param) the same.
While the user holds the FX layer's FILTER or THROW (MOMENTARY's values too, a throw on the parameter) the
producer's line waits; let go and back over RETURN it goes on from where the value is, a beat's way (vb_glide);
an effect the user holds: none of the producer's then. HOME + a black key gives that track back (its sound and
parameters as the producer has them now), HOME + EDIT every track and the buses. The hand goes over a stay in
the GROOVEBOX, stopped (vb_hs). The GROOVEBOX's SEQ pages, REC and SEQ TOOLS while the producer plays say that it
writes the next bar. The white keys play every melodic track in the song's scale (QNT WHITE), CHORDS a chord a
key (the style's triad or seventh); none of it changes a note of the songs.

tests/producer_test.c: hand_sound, hand_trip, hand_param, hand_perf, hand_notes; tests/vizzbox_mutants.py six
faults more (every one caught). The golden of 1.0's songs: unchanged.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R1rawochSWXFaES57pjc4r
